  _senarioDescription: 'You double back to the kitchen to make sure you didn''t miss
    anything. Looking around you dont see anything out of the ordinary. No footprints,
    nothing is broken, and the door is still locked. You glance over the counter
    when you notice the knives on the counter and realize that one is missing. Should
    you take a knife for protection? '
